  "body": "## 📦 v2.8.3 — 2026-10-17\r\n\r\n\r\n### 🚀 New features\r\n- Category filter and folded variants for the app list (#729)\r\n- Add DisableSelfUpdate build flag for package-managed installs (#737)\r\n- Add NotifySync to the supported plugins (#733) (#742)\r\n- Show the TV's install percentage as a progress bar (#744)\r\n- Camera PiP: write the cameras into config.js at install (#745)\r\n- Serve a pre-resolved app catalog from apps2samsung.com (no GitHub API calls on load) (#748)\r\n- Mobile: add the iOS target (one head, Android + iPhone) (#754)\r\n### 🐛 Bug fixes\r\n- Recognise install failed[118022] as the Tizen 4 spelling of the blocked package id (#738)\r\n- Stop a competing sdb server before every connect; tell the Tizen emulator apart from a TV (#739)\r\n### 🌍 Translations\r\n- i18n: new translations from Crowdin (#731)\r\n- i18n: new translations from Crowdin (#734)\r\n- i18n: new translations from Crowdin (#747)\r\n- i18n(pt-BR): complete Brazilian Portuguese translation (#752)\r\n### 🧰 Maintenance & CI\r\n- deps: Bump the nuget group with 1 update (#735)\r\n- deps: Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 (#741)\r\n- Refresh the resolved catalog when a community bundle is released (#750)\r\n### 🔀 Other changes\r\n- Release v2.8.3 (beta → master) (#740)\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @rafael-peter made their first contribution in https://github.com/Apps2Samsung/Apps2Samsung/pull/752\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apps2Samsung/Apps2Samsung/compare/v2.8.2...v2.8.3\r\n\r\n\r\n| Platform | Status | Notes |\r\n|----------|--------|-------|\r\n| 🍎 macOS (.app + dmg) | ✅ Stable | ARM64 + Intel |\r\n| 🍎 macOS (CLI) | ✅ Stable | Per-arch tar.gz |\r\n| 🐧 Linux | ✅ Stable | x64 + ARM64 (tar.gz / .deb) |\r\n| 🪟 Windows | ✅ Stable | CI-built |\r\n| 🤖 Android (.apk) | ✅ Stable | Sideload; phone as installer head |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🛡️ Security Notice\r\nAntivirus warnings may occur and are likely **false positives**.\r\n",
